CE Amplifier - AC Analysis

.include "C:/Internship Project/spice/models/2N3904.lib"

* Power Supply
Vcc VCC 0 DC 14.61767309

* Input AC Source
Vin IN 0 DC 0 AC 1

* Input Coupling Capacitor
Cin IN BASE 1.26743602e-06

* Bias Network
R1 VCC BASE 91708.22851
R2 BASE 0 14488.55383

* Transistor
Q1 COLL BASE EMIT 2N3904

* Collector Resistor
RC1 VCC COLL 1574.248235

* Emitter Resistor and Bypass
RE1 EMIT 0 3436.674404
CE1 EMIT 0 1.017731871e-08

* Output Coupling Capacitor
Cout COLL OUT 9.973997853e-05

* Load Resistor
RL1 OUT 0 1782.361291

* Temperature
.options TEMP=27.0

* DC Operating Point & AC Analysis
.control
op
print v(base)
print v(emit)
print v(coll)
print @q1[ib]
print @q1[ic]
print @q1[ie]
ac dec 20 10 1000000000
wrdata ac_gain.txt vdb(out)
wrdata ac_phase.txt vp(out)
quit
.endc

.end
